{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id182545246"}, "name":{"label":"bumsky50"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-25T16:41:27-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"8.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"14226476980"}, "title":{"label":"Avoid"}, "content":{"label":"Avoid this app. There are other apps that you can get free without risking being charged. I don’t know how this happened to charge my card and when I found out a week later, I contacted them through Apple and they refused to refund the 29.99$. They claimed that there is no refund even if the subscription is accidentally clicked. You can return things bought from Walmart or Amazon within 90 days but there is no refund for these app. It is becoming a new trend and everyone should be careful to avoid all these “3 day free trial” apps because I believe they are counting that a good percentage of people will forget to cancel within that very short period. Instead of charging my account for one month , they charged for the whole year. And even when I told them that I did not subscribe the paid app, they claimed that one of my family members may have done so. I will delete the app completely from my PHONE and will not allow them make money from me by selling their advert any longer m. LET THEM ENJOY THE $29.99.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
