{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id207331374"}, "name":{"label":"PamWebster"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-02T22:49:34-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"8.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"14137944816"}, "title":{"label":"It needs to backdate"}, "content":{"label":"I love counting my steps and have been doing this for years. I had a Fitbit before and switched to an Apple Watch just a couple years ago, but I hate that if I forget to sync my steps before midnight that they don’t count.  Fitbit always think the steps. I was on a cruise for a week when I hit land and synced my watch it would give me steps for every day.  Please fix this so that it back dates the steps.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id40596657"}, "name":{"label":"Tide@208"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-02T07:37:11-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"8.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"14135435753"}, "title":{"label":"Update Removed Step Counter"}, "content":{"label":"The old \"Pedometer++\" that helped me set goals and allowed me track steps during each individual workout. That is gone. The recent updates removed a simple step counter option for each workout. Please bring that option back -not total steps for the day, just the individual workout. \n\nNow searching for a simple individual walk step counter for my phone and apple watch. It is hard to find.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
