{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id112846888"}, "name":{"label":"Δήμητρα Τ."}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-15T12:52:46-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"8.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"14068361573"}, "title":{"label":"Love it!"}, "content":{"label":"I love Pedometer+++ !  Even the basic version works well, counting my steps and giving me distance and other metrics. This is the first time I’ve used a step up and I’m very happy with Pedometer. I do not need to go to any other step app.  If my health regimen improves greatly, I will purchase the next level of thermometer. But this one is great and works well with my Apple Watch 5 as well.  Yay!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id638948480"}, "name":{"label":"zlataazlataa"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-14T05:41:34-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"8.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"14063370324"}, "title":{"label":"Step count and daily goal history changed after travel"}, "content":{"label":"My daily step goal is over 7,000 steps, and I was closing it every day. On some days I had at least 7,100 steps, and I clearly remember seeing in the app that the goal was completed.\n\nHowever, after I traveled to Turkey and then returned to Russia, the step count for three already completed days changed and dropped below my daily goal. This should not have happened, because those days had already been completed and the goal was reached.\n\nI’m not sure if this bug is related to changing countries/time zones, but it looks like the app recalculated or changed the data retroactively.\n\nCould you please check this issue and help restore the correct step counts / completed goal status for those days?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
